        "summary": "Intense Eu-centered luminescence via complete ligand-to-metal energy transfer (no ligand emission); τexp = 0.66 ms at 298 K and 0.76 ms at 77 K; 5D0 intrinsic quantum yield 25%. χMT decreases from 6.29 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K to 0.09 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K due to Eu(III) spin–orbit coupling; fitted spin–orbit constant λ = 372(1) cm−1, consistent with 375 cm−1 from emission; exchange between Eu ions is negligible.",
